design/

# Ad-hoc scratch probe / calibration example binaries (never committed).
# The one real tracked example, crates/travsr-rerank/examples/rerank_bench.rs,
# does not match these patterns and stays tracked.
crates/*/examples/probe_*.rs
crates/*/examples/*_probe.rs
crates/*/examples/calib_*.rs

# Generated benchmark dumps and intermediates (never committed). The `_` prefix
# is the existing convention for them: no `bench/_*` file is tracked, while every
# committed bench input and harness is named without it. Untracked-but-unignored
# they were reaching `find_pattern`, which searches with
# `git grep --untracked --exclude-standard` so it can see a file the graph
# already indexes before it is `git add`ed.
bench/_*

# travsr:begin (generated AI-tool config, `travsr connect --remove` to undo)
/.mcp.json
# travsr:end
